(text "EA29~2.93V open-drain reset,200ms release.\nNRST shared withSWD/reset pad;BOOT0 defaults10kLOW.\nEA29 avoids EA30 release-margin overlap with buck tolerance.\nInterrupted NAND writes can still fail. Test brownout ramps." (at 218 183 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7c6d5bfb-badf-4a5a-a1dc-052ede3c1c57))
(text "InternalLDO mode; correctVOS/flash wait states/clocks. HSE_VALUE=8000000.\n480MHz requires compatible silicon/temperature. BOOT_ADD0/1 recovery.\nSWD primary; verifyUSBDFU and cold power cycle.\nRUN PC5/source-disable PE12 selected away from ROM output drive." (at 15 224 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid d4d89637-7d08-45e0-8ab2-24fd79f02834)) (embedded_fonts no))
